SUMMARY:Christmas Dinner for Lisbon Female Founders
DESCRIPTION:Get up-to-date information at: https://luma.com/0leb1bjm\n\nAd
 dress:\nCheck event page for more details.\n\nHi, we’re Ro and Carla, an
 d we had an idea...\nCompanies throw Christmas dinners. Secret Santa. Too 
 much wine. And someone from HR gives a speech nobody asked for.\nAnd when 
 you’re a founder without a big team?\nYour Christmas party is you, your 
 laptop, and an ugly Christmas sweater nobody sees.\nSo we’re fixing that
 .\nWe’re hosting a Christmas dinner for the female founders of Lisbon. A
 ll year you’ve been the CEO, the marketing team, the accountant, and IT 
 support. This December, you finally get the Christmas party invite.\nWhat
 ’s on the table\nGood food, good wine, and a long table full of women…
 \n\nHosted by Romana Siracusa & Carla Biesinger
