SUMMARY:Mirror Tarot with Sarah Shin and Colectivo Arquétipa
DESCRIPTION:Get up-to-date information at: https://luma.com/ka5cqmfs\n\nAd
 dress:\nWell Read\nLisboa, Portugal\n\nJoin us at Well Read for an evening
  exploring the worlds of Mirror Tarot: a book and tarot deck by Sammy Lee
  and Sarah Shin, on Spiral House. Sarah Shin, Kaitlyn Davies and members o
 f Colectivo Arquétipa will explore the tarot as a worldmaking tool and I
 talo Calvino’s conception of the tarot as ‘a machine for constructing 
 stories’.\nThey will touch upon the tarot's relationship to artistic, l
 iterary and intellectual history: from al-Andalus and the Neoplatonist Ren
 aissance to psychoanalysis, manga and cosmology.\nThe conversation will be
  followed by tarot readings using a selection of decks,…\n\nHosted by We
 ll Read
LOCATION:Well Read, CC de Sant'Ana 92 94, 1150-305 Lisboa, Portugal
